{"created": "2018-10-25T15:12:15.167811+00:00", "modified": "2025-10-30T01:59:50.343764+00:00", "id": 1471322, "conceptrecid": "1471321", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.1471322", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.1471321", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.1471322", "metadata": {"title": "Daily hydro power time series (1979-2016) for 43 Chinese reservoir  hydro stations", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.1471322", "publication_date": "2018-10-25", "description": "<p>This is the hydro time series used in the article&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><em>The role of hydro power, storage and transmission in the decarbonization of the Chinese power system</em></p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.apenergy.2019.02.009\">https://doi.org/10.1016/j.apenergy.2019.02.009</a></p>\n\n<p>Their calculations are detailed in this article:</p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.mex.2019.05.024\">https://doi.org/10.1016/j.mex.2019.05.024</a></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>--------------------------------------------</p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://zenodo.org/api/files/c3dc671c-7d64-4a5f-b535-650c7e7445b7/dams_large.csv?versionId=a2ceab14-c1e5-49be-805d-7ebce1f7b749\">dams_large.csv&nbsp;</a>&nbsp;lists the names, coordinates, provinces, historical yearly inflows, historical water consumption rate and historical yearly electricity generation of the reservoir stations.</p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://zenodo.org/api/files/c3dc671c-7d64-4a5f-b535-650c7e7445b7/reservoir_effective_capacity.pickle?versionId=9b4a5ca7-ae15-44ab-aa38-6554ed0d5a97\">reservoir_effective_capacity.pickle&nbsp;</a>&nbsp;contains the effective capacity for the reservoirs.</p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://zenodo.org/api/files/c3dc671c-7d64-4a5f-b535-650c7e7445b7/daily_hydro_inflow_per_dam_1979_2016_m3.pickle?versionId=069e756e-3fe7-4fd5-ae82-1f51618d4f77\">daily_hydro_inflow_per_dam_1979_2016_m3.pickle&nbsp;</a>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<a href=\"https://zenodo.org/api/files/c3dc671c-7d64-4a5f-b535-650c7e7445b7/daily_hydro_inflow_per_dam_1979_2016_GWh.pickle?versionId=d0bc17ce-e48b-4a5c-934f-e602f8b9f797\">daily_hydro_inflow_per_dam_1979_2016_GWh.pickle&nbsp;</a>&nbsp;contains the daily hydro inflow&nbsp;time series in terms of water (m3) and potential energy (GWh), respectively.</p>\n\n<pre><code>import pandas\n\ndata_pickle = pandas.read_pickle('*.pickle')\n\ndata_csv = pandas.read_csv('dams_large.csv')</code></pre>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Liu, Hailiang", "affiliation": "Aarhus University", "orcid": "0000-0003-0514-3417"}, {"name": "Andresen, Gorm Bruun", "affiliation": "Aarhus University", "orcid": "0000-0002-4820-020X"}, {"name": "Brown, Tom", "affiliation": "KIT", "orcid": "0000-0001-5898-1911"}, {"name": "Greiner, Martin", "affiliation": "Aarhus University", "orcid": "0000-0003-3486-247X"}], "keywords": ["hydro", "time series", "high-resolution", "power", "reservoir", "China", "dams", "energy"], "related_identifiers": [{"identifier": "https://arxiv.org/abs/1810.10347", "relation": "isSupplementTo", "scheme": "url"}], "resource_type": {"title": "Dataset", "type": "dataset"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "1471321"}}]}}, "title": "Daily hydro power time series (1979-2016) for 43 Chinese reservoir  hydro stations", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/1471322", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/1471322", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/1471322?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.1471322", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.1471322", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.1471322", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/1471322/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/1471321", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/1471321", "parent_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.1471321", "parent_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.1471321", "self_iiif_manifest": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:1